# A playtest lock is machine-local: it says someone at THIS machine is using
# the dev app. Committed, it followed the repo onto the build machine and made
# every CI run refuse to build the app bundle (2026-08-23 to 2026-09-13).
queue/playtest.lock

# A walk with no "out" of its own writes beside its script, which drops
# megabytes of renders and captures into the repo. Everything under
# Scripts/playtest belongs in /tmp; this is the net under that mistake.
Scripts/playtest/out/
